   - **DTR/RTS reset test failed** (not an error in my scripts, but a definitive negative result). Four sequences — ESP-style (`DTR=false,RTS=true` → `DTR=true,RTS=false` → both false), DTR pulse, RTS pulse, both pulse — all left the `adc` flood running. **Corrects the prior record:** my memory note said only RTS was unwired; **neither DTR nor RTS is wired to reset** on this board.
